sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as Ravi employee
    participant M as Meera operator
    participant P as Product
    participant V as Vikram approver
    participant B as Employer bank channel
    participant E as EPFO portal

    R->>P: Flags a missing punch before the cut-off
    P->>M: Regularisation resolved, inputs close at M2
    M->>P: Process and reprocess at M4 and M5
    P->>V: Sign-off artefact presented, bridge closes to zero
    V->>P: Approve and lock at M6 and M8
    P->>R: Payslip published with every line explained
    V->>B: Release the salary file, then the bank OTP, M9
    B-->>P: UTRs and the actual disbursal date
    M->>E: Upload the ECR in an attended session
    E-->>M: Return statement rendered
    P->>V: Statement reconciled member by member
    V->>P: Instruct approval, bound to the statement hash
    M->>E: Approve the return, which can never be cancelled
    E-->>M: Due Deposit Balance Summary with any 7Q interest
    Note over P,V: Verification gate - the last point for a downward correction
    V->>P: Confirm the gate at M10
    M->>E: Generate the challan with TRRN
    V->>B: Pay the challan on the employer's own authentication
    E-->>M: Receipt
    M->>P: Receipt stored, the filing instance reaches FILED
